 "result": "```python\nimport cadquery as cq\n\nOD = 25.0\nBORE = 12.7\nLENGTH = 10.0\nHOLE_D = 3.3\n\n# Tube along Z\ncollar = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"XY\")\n    .circle(OD / 2.0)\n    .circle(BORE / 2.0)\n    .extrude(LENGTH)\n)\n\n# Radial hole along +X at mid-length, through one wall only\nhole = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"YZ\")\n    .workplane(offset=BORE / 2.0 - 1.0)\n    .center(0, LENGTH / 2.0)\n    .circle(HOLE_D / 2.0)\n    .extrude(OD / 2.0 - BORE / 2.0 + 2.0)\n)\n\nresult = collar.cut(hole)\n\ncq.exporters.export(result, \"out.step\")\n```",
